<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In your daily duty, standing up for right,</l><l>Are you sometimes weary—heart not always light?</l><l>Doubt your Savior never,</l><l>This your motto ever:</l><l>I can all things, all things do</l><l>Through Christ, which strengtheneth me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If your way be weary He will help you through—</l><l>Help you in your troubles and your pleasures too;</l><l>Say, when Satan’s by you;</l><l>Say, when all things try you:</l><l>I can all things, all things do</l><l>Through Christ, which strengtheneth me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In a world of trouble, tempted oft to stray,</l><l>You need never stumble, Satan cannot stay,</l><l>Will but tempt you vainly,</l><l>If you tell him plainly:</l><l>I can all things, all things do</l><l>Through Christ, which strengtheneth me.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Jesus’ power is boundless, boundless as the sea;</l><l>He is always able, able to keep me,</l><l>Power bring from my weakness,</l><l>Glory from my meekness:</l><l>I can all things, all things do</l><l>Through Christ, which strengtheneth me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
